Reload AI Collaboration Rules

1. Do not recode Reload from scratch.
2. Work from the existing public/index.html file only unless I approve a file structure change.
3. Preserve the current working deployment.
4. Only edit, debug, refine, or extend the current prototype.
5. Before making big changes, explain what you are changing and why.
6. Ask questions when requirements are unclear.
7. Produce a working prototype first, then polish.
8. Avoid token-heavy rewrites unless absolutely necessary.
9. Keep the Reload identity: warm, therapeutic, emotional, premium, Apple-like, lightly gamified.
10. Do not remove existing features unless they are broken or I approve it.
11. Keep changes versioned: v1.1, v1.2, v1.3, etc.
12. After every change, give me:
   - what changed
   - what was fixed
   - what may still need testing
   - the final updated code
